<sc id="Santiago-4">
<cm>
<sv id="Santiago-4-1">
Where do wars and fightings among you come from? Don´t they come
from your pleasures that war in your members?
<t xml:lang="es">¿<wi type="G" value="4159,1,">De dónde</wi> vienen
<wi type="G" value="4171,2,">las guerras</wi>
<wi type="G" value="2532,3,">y</wi>
<wi type="G" value="3163,4,">peleas</wi>
<wi type="G" value="1722,5,">entre</wi>
<wi type="G" value="5213,6,">ustedes</wi>?
¿<wi type="G" value="3756,7,">No</wi> es <wi type="G" value="1782,8,">acaso</wi>
<wi type="G" value="1537,9,">de</wi>
<wi type="G" value="5216,12,">sus</wi>
<wi type="G" value="3588,10,"/><wi type="G" value="2237,11,">placeres</wi>
<wi type="G" value="3588,13,"/><wi type="G" value="4754,14,">que hacen guerra</wi>
<wi type="G" value="1722,15,">en</wi>
<wi type="G" value="5216,18,">sus</wi>
<wi type="G" value="3588,16,"/><wi type="G" value="3196,17,">miembros</wi>?
</t>
</sv>
<sv id="Santiago-4-2">
You
<wi type="T" value="P"/> lust, and don´t
have. You
<wi type="T" value="P"/> kill, covet, and can´t obtain. You
<wi type="T" value="P"/> fight and make war.
You
<wi type="T" value="P"/> don´t have, because you
<wi type="T" value="P"/> don´t ask.
<t xml:lang="es"><wi type="G" value="1937,1,">Ustedes desean</wi>,
<wi type="G" value="2532,2,">y</wi>
<wi type="G" value="3756,3,">no</wi>
<wi type="G" value="2192,4,">tienen</wi>.
<wi type="G" value="5407,5,">Matan</wi>
<wi type="G" value="2532,6,">y</wi>
<wi type="G" value="2206,7,">envidian</wi>
<wi type="G" value="2532,8,">y</wi>
<wi type="G" value="3756,9,">no</wi>

<wi type="G" value="1410,10,">pueden</wi>
<wi type="G" value="2013,11,">obtener</wi>.
<wi type="G" value="3164,12,">Pelean</wi>
<wi type="G" value="2532,13,">y</wi>
<wi type="G" value="4170,14,">hacen guerra</wi>.
<wi type="G" value="1161,17,">Pero</wi>
<wi type="G" value="3756,15,">no</wi>
<wi type="G" value="2192,16,">tienen</wi>
<wi type="G" value="1223,18,">porque</wi>
<wi type="G" value="5209,22,">ustedes</wi>
<wi type="G" value="3588,19,"/><wi type="G" value="3361,20,">no</wi>
<wi type="G" value="154,21,">piden</wi>.
</t>
</sv>
<sv id="Santiago-4-3">
You
<wi type="T" value="P"/> ask, and don´t
receive, because you
<wi type="T" value="P"/> ask with wrong motives, so that you
<wi type="T" value="P"/> may spend
it for your pleasures.
<t xml:lang="es"><wi type="G" value="154,1,">Ustedes piden</wi>
<wi type="G" value="2532,2,">y</wi>
<wi type="G" value="3756,3,">no</wi>
<wi type="G" value="2983,4,">reciben</wi>,
<wi type="G" value="1360,5,">porque</wi>
<wi type="G" value="154,7,">piden</wi>
<wi type="G" value="2560,6,">mal</wi>,
<wi type="G" value="2443,8,">para</wi>
<wi type="G" value="1159,13,">gastar</wi>
<wi type="G" value="1722,9,">en</wi>
<wi type="G" value="5216,12,">sus</wi>
<wi type="G" value="3588,10,"><wi type="G" value="2237,11,">placeres</wi></wi>.</t>
</sv>

<sv id="Santiago-4-4">
You
<wi type="T" value="P"/> adulterers and adulteresses, don´t
you
<wi type="T" value="P"/> know that friendship with the world is enmity with God? Whoever
therefore wants to be a friend of the world makes himself an enemy of God.
<t xml:lang="es"><wi type="G" value="3432,1,">Ustedes adúlteros</wi>
<wi type="G" value="2532,2,">y</wi>
<wi type="G" value="3428,3,">adúlteras</wi>,
¿<wi type="G" value="3756,4,">no</wi>
<wi type="G" value="1492,5,">saben</wi>
<wi type="G" value="3754,6,">que</wi>
<wi type="G" value="3588,7,">la</wi>
<wi type="G" value="5373,8,">amistad</wi>
con
<wi type="G" value="3588,9,">el</wi>
<wi type="G" value="2889,10,">mundo</wi>
<wi type="G" value="2076,14,">es</wi>
<wi type="G" value="2189,11,">enemistad</wi> con
<wi type="G" value="3588,12,"/><wi type="G" value="2316,13,">Dios</wi>?
<wi type="G" value="3767,17,">Así que</wi>
<wi type="G" value="302,16,">cualquiera</wi>
<wi type="G" value="3739,15,">que</wi>
<wi type="G" value="1014,18,">quiera</wi>
<wi type="G" value="1511,20,">ser</wi>
<wi type="G" value="5384,19,">amigo</wi>
<wi type="G" value="3588,21,">del</wi>
<wi type="G" value="2889,22,">mundo</wi>
<wi type="G" value="2525,26,">se hace</wi>
<wi type="G" value="2190,23,">enemigo</wi>
<wi type="G" value="3588,24,"/><wi type="G" value="2316,25,">de Dios</wi>.
</t>
</sv>

<sv id="Santiago-4-5">
Or do you think that the Scripture says in vain, «The Spirit who
lives in us yearns jealously»?
<t xml:lang="es">¿<wi type="G" value="2228,1,">O</wi>
<wi type="G" value="1380,2,">piensan</wi>
<wi type="G" value="3754,3,">que</wi>
<wi type="G" value="3588,5,"><wi type="G" value="1124,6,">la Escritura</wi></wi>
<wi type="G" value="3004,7,">dice</wi>
<wi type="G" value="2761,4,">en vano</wi>,
«<wi type="G" value="3588,11,"><wi type="G" value="4151,12,">El espíritu</wi></wi>
<wi type="G" value="3739,13,">que</wi>
<wi type="G" value="2730,14,">ha habitado</wi>
<wi type="G" value="1722,15,">en</wi>
<wi type="G" value="2254,16,">nosotros</wi>
<wi type="G" value="1971,10,">desea</wi>
<wi type="G" value="4314,8,">con</wi>
<wi type="G" value="5355,9,">envidia</wi>»?
</t>
</sv>
<sv id="Santiago-4-6">
But he gives more grace. Therefore it
says, «God resists the proud, but gives grace to the humble.»
<t xml:lang="es"><wi type="G" value="1161,2,">Pero</wi>
<wi type="G" value="1325,3,">da</wi>
<wi type="G" value="3173,1,">más</wi>
<wi type="G" value="5485,4,">gracia</wi>.
<wi type="G" value="1352,5,">Por tanto</wi>
<wi type="G" value="3004,6,">dice</wi>
«<wi type="G" value="3588,7,"><wi type="G" value="2316,8,">Dios</wi></wi>
<wi type="G" value="498,10,">resiste</wi>
<wi type="G" value="5244,9,">a los orgullosos</wi>,
<wi type="G" value="1161,12,">pero</wi>
<wi type="G" value="1325,13,">le da</wi>
<wi type="G" value="5485,14,">gracia</wi>
<wi type="G" value="5011,11,">a los humildes</wi>.»
</t>
</sv>

<sv id="Santiago-4-7">
Be subject
therefore to God. But resist the devil, and he will flee from you.
<t xml:lang="es"><wi type="G" value="3767,2,">Por tanto</wi>
<wi type="G" value="5293,1,">sométanse a</wi>
<wi type="G" value="3588,3,"/><wi type="G" value="2316,4,">Dios</wi>.
<wi type="G" value="436,5,">Resistan al</wi>
<wi type="G" value="3588,6,"/><wi type="G" value="1228,7,">diablo</wi>,
<wi type="G" value="2532,8,">y</wi>
<wi type="G" value="5343,9,">él huirá</wi>
<wi type="G" value="575,10,">de</wi>
<wi type="G" value="5216,11,">ustedes</wi>.
</t>
</sv>

<sv id="Santiago-4-8">
Draw near to God, and he will draw near to you. Cleanse your hands, you
sinners; and purify your hearts, you double-minded.
<t xml:lang="es"><wi type="G" value="1448,1,">Acérquense a</wi>
<wi type="G" value="3588,2,"/><wi type="G" value="2316,3,">Dios</wi>,
<wi type="G" value="2532,4,">y</wi>
<wi type="G" value="1448,5,">Él se acercará a</wi>
<wi type="G" value="5213,6,">ustedes</wi>.
<wi type="G" value="2511,7,">Limpien</wi> sus
<wi type="G" value="5495,8,">manos</wi>
<wi type="G" value="268,9,">pecadores</wi>,
<wi type="G" value="2532,10,">y</wi>
<wi type="G" value="48,11,">purifiquen</wi> sus
<wi type="G" value="2588,12,">corazones</wi>,
los de <wi type="G" value="1374,13,">mente doble</wi>.</t>
</sv>

<sv id="Santiago-4-9">
Lament, mourn,
and weep. Let your laughter be turned to mourning, and your joy to gloom.
<t xml:lang="es"><wi type="G" value="5003,1,">Laméntense</wi>,
<wi type="G" value="2532,2,"/><wi type="G" value="3996,3,">guarden luto</wi>
<wi type="G" value="2532,4,">y</wi>
<wi type="G" value="2799,5,">lloren</wi>.
<wi type="G" value="3344,11,">Que</wi>
<wi type="G" value="5216,8,">su</wi>
<wi type="G" value="3588,6,"/><wi type="G" value="1071,7,">risa</wi>
<wi type="GC" value="11">se convierta</wi>
<wi type="G" value="1519,9,">en</wi>
<wi type="G" value="3997,10,">lamento</wi>,
<wi type="G" value="2532,12,">y</wi>
<wi type="G" value="3588,13,">la</wi>
<wi type="G" value="5479,14,">alegría</wi>
<wi type="G" value="1519,15,">en</wi>
<wi type="G" value="2726,16,">tristeza</wi>.</t>

</sv>
<sv id="Santiago-4-10">
Humble yourselves in the sight of the Lord, and he will exalt you.
<t xml:lang="es"><wi type="G" value="5013,1,">Humíllense</wi>
<wi type="G" value="1799,2,">delante</wi>
<wi type="G" value="3588,3,"><wi type="G" value="2962,4,">del Señor</wi></wi>
<wi type="G" value="2532,5,">y</wi>
<wi type="G" value="5312,6,">Él</wi>
<wi type="G" value="5209,7,">los</wi>
<wi type="GC" value="6">exaltará</wi>.
</t>
</sv></cm>

<cm>
<sv id="Santiago-4-11">
Don´t speak against one another, brothers. He who speaks against a
brother and judges his brother, speaks against the law and judges the law.
But if you judge the law, you are not a doer of the law, but a judge.
<t xml:lang="es"><wi type="G" value="3361,1,">No</wi>
<wi type="G" value="2635,2,">hablen mal</wi>
<wi type="G" value="240,3,">unos de otros</wi>,
<wi type="G" value="80,4,">hermanos</wi>.
<wi type="G" value="3588,5,">El que</wi>
<wi type="G" value="2635,6,">habla mal</wi>
<wi type="G" value="80,7,">del hermano</wi>
<wi type="G" value="2532,8,">y</wi>
<wi type="G" value="2919,9,">juzga a</wi>
<wi type="G" value="846,12,">su</wi>
<wi type="G" value="3588,10,"/><wi type="G" value="80,11,">hermano</wi>,
<wi type="G" value="2635,13,">habla mal</wi>
<wi type="G" value="3551,14,">de la ley</wi>
<wi type="G" value="2532,15,">y</wi>
<wi type="G" value="2919,16,">juzga</wi>
<wi type="G" value="3551,17,">la ley</wi>.
<wi type="G" value="1161,19,">Pero</wi>
<wi type="G" value="1487,18,">si</wi>
<wi type="G" value="2919,21,">tú juzgas</wi>
<wi type="G" value="3551,20,">la ley</wi>,
<wi type="G" value="3756,22,">no</wi>
<wi type="G" value="1488,23,">eres</wi>
<wi type="G" value="4163,24,">hacedor</wi>
<wi type="G" value="3551,25,">de la ley</wi>,
<wi type="G" value="235,26,">sino</wi>
<wi type="G" value="2923,27,">un juez</wi>.
</t>
</sv>

<sv id="Santiago-4-12">
Only one is the lawgiver, who is able to save and to destroy. But who
are you to judge another?
<t xml:lang="es"><wi type="G" value="2076,2,">Hay</wi>
<wi type="G" value="1520,1,">un</wi>
<wi type="G" value="3588,3,"/><wi type="G" value="3550,4,">dador de la ley</wi>,
<wi type="G" value="3588,5,">quien</wi>
<wi type="G" value="1410,6,">puede</wi>
<wi type="G" value="4982,7,">salvar</wi>
<wi type="G" value="2532,8,">y</wi>
<wi type="G" value="622,9,">destruir</wi>.
¿<wi type="G" value="5101,11,">Quién</wi>
<wi type="G" value="1488,12,">eres</wi>
<wi type="G" value="4771,10,">tú</wi>
<wi type="G" value="3739,13,">para</wi>
<wi type="G" value="2919,14,">juzgar a</wi>
<wi type="G" value="3588,15,"/><wi type="G" value="2087,16,">otros</wi>?</t>
</sv></cm>

<cm>
<sv id="Santiago-4-13">
Come now, you
<wi type="T" value="P"/> who say, «Today or tomorrow let´s go into this city,
and spend a year there, trade, and make a profit.»
<t xml:lang="es"><wi type="G" value="71,1,">Vengan</wi>
<wi type="G" value="3568,2,">ahora</wi>,
<wi type="G" value="3588,3,">los que</wi>
<wi type="G" value="3004,4,">dicen</wi>,
«<wi type="G" value="4594,5,">Hoy</wi>
<wi type="G" value="2532,6,">o</wi>
<wi type="G" value="839,7,">mañana</wi>
<wi type="G" value="4198,8,">vayamos</wi>
<wi type="G" value="1519,9,">a</wi>
<wi type="G" value="3592,10,">tal</wi>
<wi type="G" value="3588,11,"/><wi type="G" value="4172,12,">ciudad</wi>
<wi type="G" value="2532,13,">y</wi>
<wi type="G" value="4160,14,">quedémonos</wi>
<wi type="G" value="1563,15,">allí</wi>
<wi type="G" value="1520,17,">un</wi>
<wi type="G" value="1763,16,">año</wi>,
<wi type="G" value="2532,18,"/><wi type="G" value="1710,19,">comerciemos</wi>
<wi type="G" value="2532,20,">y</wi>
<wi type="G" value="2770,21,">tengamos ganancia</wi>.»
</t>
</sv>

<sv id="Santiago-4-14">
Whereas you
<wi type="T" value="P"/>
don´t know what your life will be like tomorrow. For what is your life? For
you
<wi type="T" value="P"/> are a vapor, that appears for a little time, and then vanishes away.
<t xml:lang="es"><wi type="G" value="3748,1,">Pues</wi>
<wi type="G" value="3756,2,">no</wi>
<wi type="G" value="1987,3,">saben</wi>
<wi type="G" value="3588,4,">lo que</wi>
será
<wi type="G" value="3588,5,"/><wi type="G" value="839,6,">mañana</wi>.
<wi type="G" value="1063,8,">Porque</wi>
¿<wi type="G" value="4169,7,">qué</wi> es
<wi type="G" value="3588,9,">la</wi>
<wi type="G" value="2222,10,">vida</wi>
<wi type="G" value="5216,11,">de ustedes</wi>?
<wi type="G" value="1063,13,">Pues</wi>
<wi type="G" value="2076,14,">es</wi>
<wi type="G" value="822,12,">vapor</wi>,
<wi type="G" value="5316,18,">que aparece</wi>
<wi type="G" value="3588,15,"/><wi type="G" value="4314,16,">por</wi>
<wi type="G" value="3641,17,">un corto tiempo</wi>,
<wi type="G" value="1161,20,">y</wi>
<wi type="G" value="1899,19,">entonces</wi>
<wi type="G" value="853,21,">desaparece</wi>.
</t>
</sv>

<sv id="Santiago-4-15">
For you
<wi type="T" value="P"/> ought to say, «If the Lord wills, we will both live, and
do this or that.»
<t xml:lang="es"><wi type="G" value="473,1,">Por lo tanto</wi>
<wi type="G" value="5209,4,">ustedes</wi> deberían
<wi type="G" value="3588,2,"/><wi type="G" value="3004,3,">decir</wi>,
«<wi type="G" value="1437,5,">Si</wi>
<wi type="G" value="3588,6,">el</wi>
<wi type="G" value="2962,7,">Señor</wi>
<wi type="G" value="2309,8,">quiere</wi>,
<wi type="G" value="2532,9,"/><wi type="G" value="2198,10,">viviremos</wi>
<wi type="G" value="2532,11,">y</wi>
<wi type="G" value="4160,12,">haremos</wi>
<wi type="G" value="5124,13,">esto</wi>
<wi type="G" value="2228,14,">o</wi>
<wi type="G" value="1565,15,">aquello</wi>.»
</t>
</sv>

<sv id="Santiago-4-16">
But now you
<wi type="T" value="P"/> glory in your boasting. All such
boasting is evil.
<t xml:lang="es"><wi type="G" value="1161,2,">Y</wi>
<wi type="G" value="3568,1,">ahora</wi>
<wi type="G" value="2744,3,">se alegran</wi>
<wi type="G" value="1722,4,">en</wi>
lo que <wi type="G" value="5216,7,">ustedes</wi>
<wi type="G" value="3588,5,"/><wi type="G" value="212,6,">presumen</wi>.
<wi type="G" value="3956,8,">Toda</wi>
<wi type="G" value="5108,10,">esa</wi>
<wi type="G" value="2746,9,">alegría</wi>
<wi type="G" value="2076,12,">es</wi>
<wi type="G" value="4190,11,">maldad</wi>.</t>
</sv>

<sv id="Santiago-4-17">
To him therefore who knows to do good, and doesn´t do
it, to him it is sin.
<t xml:lang="es"><wi type="G" value="3767,2,">Por tanto</wi>
<wi type="G" value="1492,1,">al que sabe</wi>
<wi type="G" value="4160,4,">hacer</wi>
<wi type="G" value="2570,3,">el bien</wi>
<wi type="G" value="2532,5,">y</wi>
<wi type="G" value="3361,6,">no</wi> lo
<wi type="G" value="4160,7,">hace</wi>,
<wi type="G" value="846,9,">para él</wi>
<wi type="G" value="2076,10,">es</wi>
<wi type="G" value="266,8,">pecado</wi>.</t>
<cl/>
</sv></cm></sc>

